All ReproPatch code in this repository was created during the Meta Global AI
Developer Hackathon (event window 26 Oct - 4 Nov 2026). Git history starts on
27 Oct 2026. This includes the starter build kit (TypeScript workbench, API,
SQLite queue, scripted pagination fixture and its 42 tests), which was generated
during the event in a brainstorming session with an AI assistant and imported as
the first commit, and the live Meta integration built on top of it. No code
written before 26 Oct 2026 is included. See docs/WORK_DISCLOSURE.md.

Codex and a locally authenticated Claude Code executor assisted development.
The product's repair model is Meta muse-wonder-1.0; the optional advisory auditor
is Meta's open-weight Muse Spark Open served by Baseten. Coding assistance is not
counted as product inference or pilot evidence.

